      "entries": [
        "A winter hag can spend 1 day performing a specific ritual to create a  of black ice. Once per day, she can use the staff to cast cone of cold. The staff's magic functions only in the hands of the hag who created it; for anyone else, it is a mundane staff. If the hag dies or if the staff remains in another creature's possession for 24 hours, the staff melts into a puddle of foul-smelling water."
